      "label": "03A  User pathways | launch, tournament, and schedule",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1080,
      "height": 1920,
      "color": "#4a6080"
    },
    {
      "id": "e709026842b89bbb",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 03A  User pathways — launch, tournament, and schedule",
      "x": 44,
      "y": 45,
      "width": 992,
      "height": 65,
      "color": "#00d4ff"
    },
    {
      "id": "1c31875612ee1702",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Open app**",
      "x": 430,
      "y": 149,
      "width": 140,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#4a6080"
    },
    {
      "id": "4b8b7e6271197a03",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**AppDependencies.make**\nopen SwiftData; wire live services",
      "x": 399,
      "y": 245,
      "width": 203,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#2d7aff"
    },
    {
      "id": "d84f5f71864f09d3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**AppViewModel.load**\ncheck iCloud; fetch local settings/tournaments",
      "x": 369,
      "y": 343,
      "width": 262,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#2d7aff"
    },
    {
      "id": "07bf03f9037e410e",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Settings found?**",
      "x": 393,
      "y": 448,
      "width": 214,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#ff8c42"
    },
    {
      "id": "28e5a65e5bf863f1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**FirstRunSetupView**\nsaveFencerName -> SwiftData",
      "x": 329,
      "y": 562,
      "width": 191,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#2d7aff"
    },
    {
      "id": "81b435c6f3e8760b",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**TournamentNavigationView**\nselect / refreshCloud",
      "x": 413,
      "y": 659,
      "width": 173,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#2d7aff"
    },
    {
      "id": "e8c0aa24d74c3395",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**New Tournament**\nTournamentFormView.save",
      "x": 413,
      "y": 756,
      "width": 173,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#2d7aff"
    },
    {
      "id": "de067e9fe3cb33e6",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**AppViewModel.saveTournament**\nvalidate name; insert/update Tournament\nSwiftData save -> schedule CloudKit sync",
      "x": 377,
      "y": 859,
      "width": 244,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#00e5a0"
    },
    {
      "id": "d48df7182c8a5d28",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**TournamentDetailView**\nshow bouts / open selected bout",
      "x": 401,
      "y": 963,
      "width": 196,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#2d7aff"
    },
    {
      "id": "8c49867ad75650dc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Import Schedule**\nscreenshot(s) or Manual Entry",
      "x": 406,
      "y": 1060,
      "width": 186,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#2d7aff"
    },
    {
      "id": "b340e4e8f0187661",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Manual drafts**\nadd opponent + full-order bout number",
      "x": 278,
      "y": 1172,
      "width": 228,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#00e5a0"
    },
    {
      "id": "e63cff0c289d9f43",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Vision recognize each screenshot**\ndeterministic parse + optional on-device model\nvalidator reconciles source-backed proposal",
      "x": 521,
      "y": 1172,
      "width": 265,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#00e5a0"
    },
    {
      "id": "6d16830d09d3d77f",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Review/edit drafts**\nconfirm or discard",
      "x": 452,
      "y": 1275,
      "width": 140,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#2d7aff"
    },
    {
      "id": "687b3d47f98f1b21",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**AppViewModel.confirmSchedule**\nvalidate nonempty, opponent, positive/unique number\ninsert new Bouts; mark tournament confirmed",
      "x": 372,
      "y": 1387,
      "width": 299,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#00e5a0"
    },
    {
      "id": "7978feb45ad72669",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**BoutDetailView**\nedit/delete confirmed bout; import recordings",
      "x": 394,
      "y": 1491,
      "width": 256,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#2d7aff"
    },
    {
      "id": "95023dd401d5bf58",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**How to read**  Manual and screenshot paths meet at editable drafts. Confirmation inserts bouts; discarding drafts does not. Cloud refresh can continue after the local screen appears.",
      "x": 52,
      "y": 1585,
      "width": 976,
      "height": 75,
      "color": "#00d4ff"
    },
    {
      "id": "37156f183b62c2fa",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Color legend",
      "x": 52,
      "y": 1670,
      "width": 976,
      "height": 45
    },
    {
      "id": "f517567589291691",
